   "text": "The Final Fantasy Starter Kit is a 2-Player Starter Set for Magic: The Gathering that was released on June 13, 2025.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The Starter Kit is a learn-to-play product aimed at new players, including instructional materials that guide two players through their first game. Each deck contains six exclusive cards, headlined by a traditional foil mythic rare card. All cards in the Starter Kit are Standard legal. Spanish-language cards from the Starter Kit were leaked - reportedly from Chile - two months before the release of the set.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 60-card preconstructed decks , including a foil card each",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 How-to-play guide booklet",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 double-sided reference cards (Turn Order/Attacking & Blocking)",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 Arena redemption cards , one per deck, to unlock both decks to play online in Magic: The Gathering Arena",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
